 The\n49\t  configuration surface is the Dashboard admin settings backed by the OdhDashboardConfig\n50\t  custom resource, as documented in the RHOAI architecture context.\n51\t- Provide curated defaults for every removed or hidden option that preserve current\n52\t  behavior for existing deployments.\n53\t- Make the changed configuration surface reversible via a feature flag or equivalent\n54\t  rollback mechanism, since this modifies an existing capability.\n55\t- Update captions, references, and settings documentation that fall out of the same\n56\t  change (no new content authored).\n57\t\n58\t## Acceptance Criteria\n59\t\n60\t- The count of exposed administration configuration options matches the reduced set\n61\t  defined in the investigation decision record.\n62\t- Deployments that used the previous defaults exhibit unchanged behavior after the\n63\t  change (defaults preserve prior outcomes).\n64\t- The changed surface is reversible via a feature flag or documented rollback path.\n65\t- Every removed option has a documented default value, and existing administrator\n66\t  workflows are regression-tested against the reduced surface.\n67\t\n68\t## HLR Traceability\n69\t\n70\t- **HLR-1** (administration should be simpler): implements the simplification direction —\n71\t  fewer exposed configuration options with curated defaults.\n72\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b0e45f1a5d9d5b82","agent_id":"a00317b63ea50ba62","session_id":"98e9d94a-7db9-4011-b4e9-ddd4548bd187","uuid":"ba6320eb-3f29-4c44-b747-16092097e239","timestamp":"2026-10-22T14:18:22.794Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a557f3de803bd9fa","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9008"}
